{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19098","headline":"窦朗州见示与澧州元郎中早秋赠荅命同作 · 刘禹锡","name":"窦朗州见示与澧州元郎中早秋赠荅命同作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"邻境诸侯同舍郎，芷江兰浦恨无梁。\n秋风门外旌旗动，晓露庭中橘柚香。\n玉簟微凉宜白昼，金笳入暮应清商。\n骚人昨夜闻鶗鴂，不叹流年惜衆芳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19098.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19098","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}